sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Angular Web UI
    participant EDGE as API Edge
    participant AUTH as Authorization Policy Service
    participant PCMD as Pricing Command API
    participant SIM as Simulation Service
    participant ORCH as Price Change Orchestrator
    participant CALC as Calculation Engine
    participant PREP as Pricing Repository
    participant QPROJ as Query Projection Writer
    participant OUT as Publication Outbox
    participant OPUB as Outbox Publisher
    participant K as Kafka
    participant CON as Price Publication Consumer
    participant CMS as Channel Management System

    U->>UI: Select hotel/dates and enter price change
    UI->>EDGE: Submit simulate or commit request
    EDGE->>AUTH: Coarse-grained function check
    AUTH-->>EDGE: Allowed

    EDGE->>PCMD: Forward request
    PCMD->>AUTH: Fine-grained hotel/function authorization
    AUTH-->>PCMD: Authorized

    alt Simulation request
        PCMD->>SIM: Simulate change
        SIM->>CALC: Calculate derived prices
        CALC-->>SIM: Simulated prices
        SIM-->>PCMD: Simulation result + rule version
        PCMD-->>EDGE: Return simulation result
        EDGE-->>UI: Show simulated prices
    else Commit request
        PCMD->>ORCH: Commit change
        ORCH->>CALC: Calculate committed prices
        CALC-->>ORCH: Final calculated prices
        ORCH->>PREP: Persist authoritative prices
        ORCH->>QPROJ: Update query-ready prices
        ORCH->>OUT: Record durable publication event
        ORCH-->>PCMD: Commit success
        PCMD-->>EDGE: Success response
        EDGE-->>UI: Price change accepted and query-ready

        OPUB->>OUT: Read pending publication
        OUT-->>OPUB: Pending event
        OPUB->>K: Publish price change event
        K-->>CON: Deliver event
        CON->>CMS: Push updated prices
        CMS-->>CON: Acknowledgement
    end